          "id": "zib-race",
          "title": "Zib's Race",
          "text": "Dear friend, I ran a race with a tortoise. I ran fast, and then I had a nap. The tortoise did not stop. The tortoise won! Slow and steady wins the race. Your friend, Zib",
          "questions": [
            { "q": "What did Zib do in the race?", "options": ["had a nap", "ate a cake", "flew away"], "a": "had a nap", "evidence": "then I had a nap" },
            { "q": "Who won the race?", "options": ["the tortoise", "Zib", "the hare"], "a": "the tortoise", "evidence": "The tortoise won" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "zib-rhymes",
          "title": "Zib Likes Rhymes",
          "text": "Dear friend, I like rhymes! Rain, rain, go away. Come again some other day. Jack and Jill went up the hill. Hill and Jill rhyme! Can you find a rhyme? Your friend, Zib",
          "questions": [
            { "q": "Which word rhymes with Jill?", "options": ["hill", "rain", "day"], "a": "hill", "evidence": "Hill and Jill rhyme" },
            { "q": "What does Zib like?", "options": ["rhymes", "snow", "drums"], "a": "rhymes", "evidence": "I like rhymes" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
